  "title": "FSSAI and PIL in Delhi Over Dairy Paneer and Non-Dairy Claims",
  "summary": "Delhi High Court seeks the FSSAI’s stand in a PIL case to address concerns over the sale of dairy analogue/non-dairy products as paneer, highlighting the need for proper labeling and consumer awareness.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The PIL petitioners claim that non-dairy, analogue products lack nutritional value and are considered a non-milk substitute.",
      "confidence": 0.95
